# Dashboard UI

Financial data tool — calm, editorial, Notion/Linear-like (not generic blue SaaS).

- Warm bone canvas `#F7F6F3`, white surfaces, borders `#EAEAEA`
- Headings: Newsreader serif; body: IBM Plex Sans KR; numbers: tabular + IBM Plex Mono
- Flat cards: 1px border, 8–10px radius, no heavy shadows
- Primary actions: near-black `#111`, not bright blue fills
- Buy/sell: muted pastels (pale green/red backgrounds), not neon
- Dense tables: generous row padding, clear hierarchy, hover `#F3F2EF`
- Korean UI copy; no emoji icons

When redesigning, prefer CSS token changes over new JS unless layout requires it.
